  "releaseNotes": "## DapperGlib 1.6.0\n\nDapperGlib 1.6.0 introduces a new metadata-based relationship system, eager loading, relationship aggregates, strongly typed query expressions, and additional relationship-loading APIs.\n\n### Relationships\n\n- Added attribute-based relationship definitions:\n  - `[HasMany]`\n  - `[HasOne]`\n  - `[BelongsTo]`\n- Relationship keys can omit the related key when both sides use the same property name.\n- Added cached relationship metadata and model configuration validation.\n- Added strongly typed relationship expressions using lambda expressions.\n- Legacy `Relationship<T>` APIs remain available for existing code, while the new 1.6 relationship features use metadata-based navigation properties.\n\nExample:\n\n```csharp\n[HasMany(nameof(UserId), Chaperone = true)]\npublic List<Post> Posts { get; set; } = new();\n\n[HasOne(nameof(UserId))]\npublic UserProfile? Profile { get; set; }\n\n[BelongsTo(nameof(UserId))]\npublic User? User { get; set; }",
